# Code Review (Five Axes)

Review every non-trivial change: **correctness, readability, architecture, security, performance**.

## LakanVault-specific checks
- [ ] `verify_boundaries.py` passes
- [ ] No raw PII in audit metadata
- [ ] Threat scanner does not read prompt text (ADR-002)
- [ ] UI has no business logic (ADR-004)
- [ ] PyInstaller paths use runtime helper, not hardcoded `parents[n]`
- [ ] New deps justified and minimal

## Severity labels
- **Critical** — blocks merge (security, data loss)
- *(no prefix)* — required fix
- **Optional** / **Nit** — author may defer

## Sprint gate
Get real peer review (Kartik) before starting next sprint.
